# Rust
/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# ts-rs's default export directory (`./bindings`, relative to whichever crate a test
# runs in). A plain `cargo test --workspace` — with no `TS_RS_EXPORT_DIR` set — runs
# every `#[ts(export)]` type's generated test and writes here. The real, intentional
# output lives at frontend/src/api/generated/ instead, written by `make types`.
**/bindings/

# Node
node_modules/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo
npm-debug.log*

# Secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Editors and OS
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
